{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshot-streaming","title":"初始快照、增量切换与一致性边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-integration-cdc/debezium-cdc/snapshot-streaming","wordCount":2274,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"初始快照-增量切换与一致性边界\">初始快照、增量切换与一致性边界</h1><p>一个 CDC 连接器刚启动时面对的是一个矛盾:实时流只包含&quot;从现在开始&quot;的变更,但数仓需要全部历史数据。解决办法是先做一次<strong>初始快照</strong>(把表的当前全量读出来发送),再切换到实时流。这中间有一个窄窄的窗口,快照读到一半时数据被修改了——如果处理不当,这一行要么在数仓里丢失,要么以旧值出现且永远不会被纠正。这一篇讲的就是如何把窗口关严。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个时刻与两种顺序\">核心概念：三个时刻与两种顺序</h2><p>快照与流的切换之所以容易出错,是因为它涉及三个时间点:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:快照开始读表的时刻</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:快照读完表的时刻</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:连接器开始读取 binlog/WAL 的时刻</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>正确的顺序是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_l &lt; t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>,即&quot;先开始读日志,再开始读表&quot;。这个顺序的含义是:连接器从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 开始记录所有变更,然后扫描表得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的一个(近似)一致视图,而那些在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_l, t_e]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 之间发生的变更同时存在于日志流中。当快照完成后播放日志流时,连接器可以用日志中的变更去修正快照中可能已经过时的行。这样即使某行在扫描过程中被修改,最终也会收敛到正确值。</p>\n<p><strong>如果顺序反了(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s &lt; t_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)</strong>,那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_s, t_l]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 窗口内的变更既不在快照里(读的时候还没发生),也不在日志流里(还没开始读),这段数据永久丢失。这是 CDC 最经典的数据丢失模式,也是&quot;数仓比业务库少了几万行&quot;最常见的技术原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant DB as 源数据库&#10;    participant C as Debezium 连接器&#10;    participant K as Kafka&#10;    Note over C,K: 记录位点 L_low&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;DB: 开始读 binlog/WAL(不发送)&#10;    Note over C: t_l&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;DB: 一致性快照: SET TRANSACTION ISOLATION&#10;    Note over DB: 可选:表锁 / 事务快照&#10;    loop 逐表 SELECT 分批读取&#10;        DB--&gt;&gt;C: 当前行镜像&#10;        C-&gt;&gt;K: op=r(READ) 事件&#10;    end&#10;    Note over C: t_e&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;K: 快照结束标记&#10;    Note over C: 记录位点 L_high&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;DB: 从 L_low 开始播放变更&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;K: op=c/u/d 事件\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant DB as 源数据库\n    participant C as Debezium 连接器\n    participant K as Kafka\n    Note over C,K: 记录位点 L_low\n    C-&gt;&gt;DB: 开始读 binlog/WAL(不发送)\n    Note over C: t_l\n    C-&gt;&gt;DB: 一致性快照: SET TRANSACTION ISOLATION\n    Note over DB: 可选:表锁 / 事务快照\n    loop 逐表 SELECT 分批读取\n        DB--&gt;&gt;C: 当前行镜像\n        C-&gt;&gt;K: op=r(READ) 事件\n    end\n    Note over C: t_e\n    C-&gt;&gt;K: 快照结束标记\n    Note over C: 记录位点 L_high\n    C-&gt;&gt;DB: 从 L_low 开始播放变更\n    C-&gt;&gt;K: op=c/u/d 事件</pre><p>图中 <code>L_low</code> 与 <code>L_high</code> 之间的日志区间是<strong>必须保留</strong>的——如果这个区间的日志被清理(MySQL 场景),快照做完也无法续上,只能重来。这就是为什么在做大表快照期间要确保 binlog 保留期足够,或者干脆在做快照前临时调长保留期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快照的四种模式\">快照的四种模式</h2><p>Debezium 提供四种快照模式,选择哪一种取决于表的大小、是否能容忍锁、以及是否已有历史数据。</p>\n<p><strong><code>initial</code>(默认)</strong>。首次启动做全量快照,之后只读增量。这是最常见的模式。快照期间的读操作:MySQL 使用全局读锁(取决于 <code>snapshot.locking.mode</code>),PostgreSQL 使用可重复读事务快照(配合 <code>pgoutput</code> 的 exported snapshot)。</p>\n<p><strong><code>initial_only</code></strong>。只做快照,不做增量,做完后连接器停止。适合一次性把历史数据搬进来、之后由别的通道负责增量的场景,或者用于&quot;重建数仓&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong><code>schema_only</code></strong>。不做快照,只从当前位点开始读增量。适合数仓已有历史数据、只需要&quot;从现在开始&quot;的变更的场景。风险是如果数仓的历史数据本身不完整,这个缺口不会被自动修复。</p>\n<p><strong><code>no_data</code></strong>。读 schema 但跳过数据,只捕获后续变更。与 <code>schema_only</code> 的区别在于它仍然会读表的元数据用于构建 schema topic。</p>\n<p>Debezium 3.x 之后还有 <strong><code>initial_only</code> 与 <code>when_needed</code></strong> 的扩展,以及 <code>snapshot.mode=configuration_based</code> 允许更细的声明式控制。核心判断是:第一次接入一张有历史的表用 <code>initial</code>,数仓已有数据用 <code>schema_only</code>,需要严格控制锁的影响时用增量快照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>快照</th>\n<th>增量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>initial</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>首次接入</td>\n<td>锁影响、快照耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>initial_only</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>一次性搬运历史</td>\n<td>之后的变更需另建通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>schema_only</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>数仓已有历史</td>\n<td>历史缺口不自愈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>incremental</code></td>\n<td>分块</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>超大表、不能长时间持锁</td>\n<td>需理解信号表机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"增量快照-解决大表与锁的冲突\">增量快照:解决大表与锁的冲突</h2><p>传统快照对一张十亿行的表有两个问题:一是耗时长(可能几小时),二是期间可能持锁影响线上。<strong>增量快照(incremental snapshot)</strong> 用完全不同的思路解决:它把快照拆成一批批小块,每块读完就发一个事件,然后<strong>继续处理实时流</strong>,再读下一块。整个过程不需要长时间持锁,且可以中途暂停恢复。</p>\n<p>机制的关键是<strong>信号表(signal table)</strong>。你在源库里创建一张普通表:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE dbz_signal (&#10;  id VARCHAR(42) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  type VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  data VARCHAR(2048) NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE TABLE dbz_signal (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id VARCHAR(42) PRIMARY KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data VARCHAR(2048) NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>然后向它插入一行来触发动作:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO dbz_signal VALUES (&#39;ad-hoc-1&#39;, &#39;execute-snapshot&#39;,&#10;  &#39;{&quot;data-collections&quot;: [&quot;inventory.orders&quot;], &quot;type&quot;: &quot;incremental&quot;}&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>INSERT INTO dbz_signal VALUES ('ad-hoc-1', 'execute-snapshot',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  '{\"data-collections\": [\"inventory.orders\"], \"type\": \"incremental\"}');</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Debezium 会捕获这条 INSERT(因为它本身就在读日志),解析出指令,然后执行增量快照。另外几种信号类型:<code>stop-snapshot</code> 停止进行中的快照,<code>log</code> 让连接器把一条消息打进日志(用于调试),3.x 还加入了 <code>pause-snapshot</code> / <code>resume-snapshot</code>。</p>\n<p>增量快照的一致性靠一个巧妙的排水(deduplication)机制保证:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对于每个分块(chunk),Debezium 记录下这个块的主键范围;</li>\n<li>读取块内所有行,发出 <code>op=r</code> 事件;</li>\n<li>继续处理实时流中的变更,发出 <code>op=c/u/d</code> 事件;</li>\n<li>对于每一行,<strong>用&quot;窗口内事件的最高序号&quot;决定哪个事件胜出</strong>——来自快照的 <code>op=r</code> 与来自流的 <code>op=u</code> 可能都描述同一行,后者的序号更大,所以它胜出。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个机制的正确性依赖于一个前提:<strong>同一行的所有事件在同一个分区内、且有序</strong>。Debezium 用主键哈希分区(而不是表分区),保证同一行的所有事件落到同一个 partition 且保持顺序。这也解释了为什么增量快照会把 topic 的分区键从默认值改成主键——如果你手动干预了分区策略,这个机制会被破坏。</p>\n<p>一个实操要点:增量快照的分块边界是按主键区间划分的,所以<strong>主键应该是连续且分布均匀的类型</strong>(自增整数最好,UUID 也可以但分布影响分块效率)。用字符串主键时如果分布倾斜,某些块会特别大,整体耗时被拖长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性的边界条件\">一致性的边界条件</h2><p>几种常见场景下,Debezium 的一致性保证到什么程度:</p>\n<p><strong>单表快照 + 该表在快照期间被修改。</strong> 保证:最终一致。快照发出的行可能是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的值,但后续流中的变更会把它修正到最新。</p>\n<p><strong>单表快照 + 快照期间该表被 TRUNCATE。</strong> TRUNCATE 在 binlog 里是一个 DDL 语句,Debezium 会把表结构变更放到 schema 变更 topic 中。数据层面的行为取决于触发时机:如果 TRUNCATE 发生在快照过程中,快照读到的是空表或部分表,这不一定能自愈。这类操作应在快照完成窗口之外执行。</p>\n<p><strong>多表快照。</strong> 表之间不保证是同一个时间点的一致视图——Debezium 逐表快照,表 A 的一致性时刻与表 B 不同。所以如果你的下游需要跨表一致(比如订单表与订单明细表做 join 后行数应该匹配),快照阶段可能出现短暂的交叉不一致。解决办法是等全部表的快照完成、流处理追平延迟后再跑对账,而不是在快照进行中就去校验跨表关系。</p>\n<p><strong>心跳与延迟检测。</strong> 一个静默的数据库(没有写入)不会产生任何 binlog 事件,连接器看起来&quot;卡住了&quot;其实只是没数据。Debezium 提供心跳机制(<code>heartbeat.interval.ms</code>),连接器周期性地向 <code>heartbeat.topics.prefix</code> 指定的 topic 发消息,既用于确认连接存活,也让&quot;无变更&quot;状态可区分于&quot;连接断开&quot;。同时可以设置 <code>heartbeat.action.query</code> 在源库上执行一条轻量查询(比如更新一张心跳表),给复制槽的确认提供推进动力——这在 PostgreSQL 上尤其重要,因为槽的 <code>retained_wal</code> 只在消费者确认后才会推进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>切换顺序必须是&quot;先读日志(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)、后读表(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)&quot;;反过来会永久丢失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_s, t_l]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 窗口内的变更。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间的日志必须在快照期间保持可用,大表快照前应检查 binlog 保留期。</li>\n<li>快照模式的选择取决于表大小与是否已有历史数据;<code>initial</code> 是默认,<code>schema_only</code> 用于已有历史,<code>incremental</code> 用于超大表或不能持锁的场景。</li>\n<li>增量快照靠信号表触发、靠&quot;分块快照事件与流事件对比序号&quot;去重,前提是同一行的事件在同一分区内有序——所以不要手动干预分区键。</li>\n<li>多表快照之间不保证同一时刻的一致视图,跨表对账应等到快照完成且延迟追平之后再做。</li>\n<li>心跳既是存活探测,也是让 PostgreSQL 复制槽的保留水位推进的手段;静默库的&quot;卡住&quot;往往是假象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一节处理长期运行中的变化:业务改了表结构之后,CDC 如何捕获与路由这些变更事件;而快照完成后目标表与源表是否真的对齐,由 <a href=\"../idempotency-contracts/contracts-monitoring\">对账与新鲜度监控</a> 来证明。快照所需的位点信息来源见 <a href=\"binlog-wal-lsn\">MySQL binlog 与 PostgreSQL WAL 位点机制</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"初始快照、增量切换与一致性边界","id":"初始快照-增量切换与一致性边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个时刻与两种顺序","id":"核心概念-三个时刻与两种顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"快照的四种模式","id":"快照的四种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"增量快照:解决大表与锁的冲突","id":"增量快照-解决大表与锁的冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性的边界条件","id":"一致性的边界条件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MySQL Binlog、PostgreSQL WAL 与位点机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-integration-cdc/debezium-cdc/binlog-wal-lsn"},"next":{"title":"Schema 变更事件与 Topic 路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-integration-cdc/debezium-cdc/schema-change-topics"}}